The \`icons/lucide\` line registers the icon set — \`@ui-organized/react\` imports no icon library itself, so without it every \`<Icon>\` renders nothing. Swap \`lucide\` for \`tabler\` or \`heroicons\` to match the project, and make sure the matching package is installed.

## What it is

Buttons trigger actions. Use \`intent\` to convey emphasis and tone, \`size\` for density.

